# FAQ

## Where should I ask questions?
Use **GitHub Discussions** for Q&A and troubleshooting questions.

## Where do I report bugs?
Use **GitHub Issues** for actionable bugs with reproduction steps.

## Is this repo the official product documentation?
No. The official documentation is on Microsoft Learn:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/extended-zones/

## How do I request a new feature or service support?
Open a **Discussion** in the "Ideas" category first. If maintainers agree it is actionable for the repo, it may be converted into an Issue.

## How do I report a security vulnerability?
Follow [SECURITY.md](../SECURITY.md).
